- `swift format lint --strict` over the changed Swift/Tuist inputs: `0`.
- `make apple-ui-test-contract`: `0`; final log `.temp/TASK-260715-1idq8c/apple-ui-test-contract-05.log`.
- `make apple-ui-test-smoke`: `0`; final log `.temp/TASK-260715-1idq8c/apple-ui-test-smoke-03.log`.
